+
+## Validation summary
+
+| check | result |
+|---|---|
+| `cargo test --lib` (full) | **2377 passed, 0 failed**, 6 ignored |
+| `phi_eliminate` module | 32 / 32 |
+| `scripts/ci_local.sh --fast` | **20 passed, 0 failed, 3 skipped** |
